      },
      "message": "fix(trochoid): a Trochoidal slot stays inside its selection or is refused\n\nA Trochoidal slot with a face or edge selection generated a path across\nthe selected pocket's wall into the model and reported OK (the post's\nstock-sim gouge clause did refuse it). Generation now checks that the\nslot's capsule (centre line A-B, half-width width/2) lies inside the\npicked region and refuses by name with the numbers otherwise. The law\nlives in operation::slot_fit::refuse_unfit_slot, shareable with the\nplain Slot (#1504).\n\nPinned by trochoid_confine (screenshot setup refused, MCP refusal, a\nfitting slot posts clean, the post refuses an unconfined slot into the\nmodel) and slot_fit unit tests.\n\nRefs #1503\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
