      "message": "test(trochoid): near-miss pins hold the slot fit tolerance\n\nFIT_TOL (1e-4 mm) could loosen to just under 2 mm with every pin green:\nthe smallest refused overrun was 2-3 mm. Each new slot_fit unit pin sets\na 0.01 mm overrun beside its exact fit: past the end wall, too wide for\nthe region, a centre line too close to a hole. trochoid_confine adds the\nend-wall near miss through generate, and an edge-chain pick (the\npocket rim's four edges) that confines the slot the way the floor face\ndoes.\n\nRefs #1503\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
